st graduate school and you  know so maybe it just takes a bit of  time and and uh you know getting humbled  from uh occasion to occasion to get  yourself out of this and so I'm kind of  trying to save you some of that time  yourself if you're this is one of those  if the shoe fits wears it sort of uh  conversations if it does fit maybe think  about what you're doing and whether it's  good for you to be so interested in  jumping from philosopher to philosophers  like oh Sim you know similar similar  similar similar same same same let's go  on them all together that's not really  good for you and it'll stand in the way  of your own philosophical development so  you know  there's some things here to think about  hope that it's useful for you and I'll  see you next time
 

